# drizzle-kit snapshots are machine-generated and must stay tracked:
# `drizzle-kit migrate` (CI + Railway preDeployCommand) reads meta/_journal.json,
# and `generate` diffs schema.ts against the latest snapshot. Collapse them in
# PR diffs instead of deleting them.
drizzle/meta/*.json linguist-generated=true -diff

# `.jules/bolt.md` is an index that concurrent Bolt runs have historically
# appended to, producing the same conflict on every overlapping PR. Entries now
# live one-per-file in `.jules/bolt/`, but the agent that writes them is
# configured outside this repo, so union-merge this file as a fallback: if two
# runs do append here, git keeps both sides instead of blocking the merge.
.jules/bolt.md merge=union
